comments.body:
@thomasmenges can you be more specific with errors you get while building AAPS wear target? Or when you try to install with `adb install` - you also should get either success confirmation or error message.

With current Android Studio (Arctic Fox 2020.3.1 Patch 4) and on `3.0-rc3` branch i have no problems to build wear target - and to install it on Sony Smartwatch 3 (SWR50). Watch itself is correctly detected by ADB and can be debugged and monitored via Studio, as seen below:

![studio64_ZkZRVL1UG0](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5094588/150217401-79b451b5-24da-404e-8918-ec4d6c77a192.png)
